Pure tool-execution range: multiple webfetch calls plus a paseo_browser session (new_tab, wait) targeting OpenHands SDK condenser paths. The only narrative was a status ping about stamping consumed outputs and continuing with the browser snapshot. No user messages in this range.

## 13-17 · Extracted microcompact references from Claude Code changelog
Fetched the full Claude Code CHANGELOG.md (1.1 MB, saved to disk via webfetch). Attempted to delegate the microcompact line extraction to an explore subagent, but delegation was refused because this session is itself a delegated subagent (one-level limit). Fell back to grepping the changelog file directly for microcompact/micro-compact/tool-result mentions.

## 18-22 · Harvested existing research file and corrected malformed webfetch URLs
I globbed `docs/research/*.md` to find existing files on the current topic, found two written today, and read one to harvest verified citations rather than re-deriving them. I then attempted two webfetches that were malformed (wrong URLs) and corrected to use the real URLs directly.
